{"agent_id":"pp3g-jKV3-tight-scope-doc-update-issue-206-document-the-989b","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-06T04:05:16.010887909Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8bf6662b-afe9-49ba-ab5a-17394445d17d","title":"DOCUMENT VALIDATED HYDRATION RECOVERY: 'crosslink compact' is the safe recovery when the main-repo DB re-hydrates to a stale baseline (June-9) and local-only issues appear 'lost'","description":"VALIDATED in TWO independent incidents (tripn-astro 2026-08-03, another repo 2026-08-06). PROCEDURE: (1) crosslink compact (reduces local events + checkpoint into fresh state, re-hydrates DB — this restores the read path); (2) crosslink sync; (3) crosslink issue list to verify. DO NOT blind-sync repeatedly or re-hydrate blindly (that caused the rollback). If compact does NOT restore: re-create active issues from hub agent refs (git show refs/heads/crosslink/agents/<id>/events.log — IssueCreated events have full content), not from scratch. DOCUMENT WHERE: agent-orchestration-playbook.md hydration-recovery section + #126 catalog (the hydration doc). Keep the playbook note REPO-AGNOSTIC (no internal issue refs); keep issue-number detail on #125/#126. Until the root cause (#125) is fixed, this is the standing recovery. Flash model.","priority":"medium","created_by":"pp3g-jKV3-tight-scope-doc-update-issue-206-document-the-989b"},"signed_by":"SHA256:TVEBM0SPinzAy2jd43wRr6ByZ3l6hFxGm3NmHpgeGKE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIC99R5fDbdogvYlrix8Ou6z6FO1I8585b4rLlvvo/64AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPX2CNY0gaD9CpLgdQDgrP/wV7oQlA4uf1YTgt8iq6gIeakLTTVZsRmorB3UxVHumj/EAGACj/v8x5bfgxx79QA="}
